cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use TraCast, please cite it as below.
title: "TraCast: traffic-speed forecasting on METR-LA"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: ivanimmanuel-dev
repository-code: "https://github.com/ivanimmanuel-dev/TraCast"
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
abstract: >-
  Traffic-speed forecasting on METR-LA, from recurrent baselines to federated graph
  models, on a CPU. Covers shared-weight and diffusion GRUs, conformal prediction
  intervals, drift and adaptation, forecasting for unseen sensors, and federated
  learning with Flower on all 207 sensors.
keywords:
  - traffic forecasting
  - METR-LA
  - graph neural networks
  - federated learning
  - conformal prediction
